    <h1 class="text-center text-white">Welcome to the Street Fighter 6 Database</h1>
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/94/Street_Fighter_6_box_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" alt="Street Fighter 6" class="img-fluid" style="width: 300px;">
    <p class="text-center text-white">Street Fighter 6 is a fighting game developed by Capcom. 
        It was released in 2023 to wide critical acclaim and is still, 3 years later, one of the most popular entries in the fighting game genre.   
        The gameplay sees the player press buttons to perform special moves and combos while effectively defending against opponents doing the same to them.
        It is at times a methodical mind game, and a superb test of reaction speed and execution.
        Can you reach the top of the ranks in this iconic fighting game?</p>
</div>
<div class="text-center text-white">
    <p>Explore the world of Street Fighter 6 and discover your favorite characters!</p>
</div>
<a href="index.html" class="btn btn-primary text-dark">Back to Characters</a>


